{"parse": {"title": "\u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo", "pageid": 13439252, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"bandeau-container metadata homonymie hatnote\"><div class=\"bandeau-cell bandeau-icone\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Homonymie\" title=\"Aide:Homonymie\"><img alt=\"Page d\u2019aide sur l\u2019homonymie\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/20px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Logo_disambig.svg/40px-Logo_disambig.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"375\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"bandeau-cell\" style=\"display:table-cell;padding-right:0.5em\">\n<p>Pour les articles homonymes, voir <a href=\"/wiki/Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">Antetoko\u00fanmpo</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">\u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Alex_Antetokounmpo_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article \u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Alex_Antetokounmpo_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Alex_Antetokounmpo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"288\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/Alex_Antetokounmpo_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Alex_Antetokounmpo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2132\" data-file-height=\"3068\" /></a></span> \n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Nom complet\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Emeka Adetokunbo\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Nigeria.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Nigeria\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Flag_of_Nigeria.svg/20px-Flag_of_Nigeria.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Flag_of_Nigeria.svg/40px-Flag_of_Nigeria.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span></span> <span data-sort-value=\"Nigeria\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nigeria\" title=\"Nigeria\">Nig\u00e9rian</a></span><br /><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Greece.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : Gr\u00e8ce\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Flag_of_Greece.svg/20px-Flag_of_Greece.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Flag_of_Greece.svg/40px-Flag_of_Greece.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></span> <span data-sort-value=\"Grece\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gr%C3%A8ce\" title=\"Gr\u00e8ce\">Grec</a></span> <small>(2021\u2013)</small>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Naissance\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"2001-08-26\" data-sort-value=\"2001-08-26\"><a href=\"/wiki/26_ao%C3%BBt_en_sport\" title=\"26 ao\u00fbt en sport\">26 ao\u00fbt</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2001_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2001 en basket-ball\">2001</a></time><span class=\"noprint\"> (25&#160;ans)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Ath%C3%A8nes\" title=\"Ath\u00e8nes\">Ath\u00e8nes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gr%C3%A8ce\" title=\"Gr\u00e8ce\">Gr\u00e8ce</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Taille\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">2,03&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A8tre\" title=\"M\u00e8tre\">m</a> (6<a href=\"/wiki/Pied_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pied (unit\u00e9)\">\u2032</a>&#160;8<a href=\"/wiki/Pouce_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pouce (unit\u00e9)\">\u2033</a>)\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Poids\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">97&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Kilogramme\" title=\"Kilogramme\">kg</a> (213&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Livre_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Livre (unit\u00e9)\">lb</a>)\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Situation en club</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Club actuel\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_the_United_States.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau : \u00c9tats-Unis\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/20px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1235\" data-file-height=\"650\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bucks_de_Milwaukee\" title=\"Bucks de Milwaukee\">Bucks de Milwaukee</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Num\u00e9ro\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">29\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Poste\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Ailier (basket-ball)\">Ailier</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Carri\u00e8re universitaire ou amateur</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">2016-2020\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Dominican_High_School_(Whitefish_Bay,_Wisconsin)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Dominican High School (Whitefish Bay, Wisconsin) (page inexistante)\">Dominican High School</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dominican_High_School_(Whitefish_Bay,_Wisconsin)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Dominican High School (Whitefish Bay, Wisconsin)\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;Dominican High School (Whitefish Bay, Wisconsin)&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Draft de la NBA</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Ann\u00e9e\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2021_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2021 de la NBA\">2021</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Position\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Non draft\u00e9\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Carri\u00e8re professionnelle *</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:28%;\"><b>Saison</b></td><td><b>Club</b></td><td><b><abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Moyenne\">Moy.</abbr> <abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"points\">pts</abbr></b></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">2020-2021<br />2020-2021<br />2021-2022<br />2022-2023<br />2023-2024<br />2024<br />2024<br />2024-2025<br />2025<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Saison_NBA_2025-2026\" title=\"Saison NBA 2025-2026\">2025-2026</a><br />2025-2026</td><td valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/wiki/CB_Murcie\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CB Murcie\">UCAM Murcie</a><br /><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> UCAM Murcie B<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Raptors_905\" title=\"Raptors 905\">Raptors 905</a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/Herd_du_Wisconsin\" title=\"Herd du Wisconsin\">Herd du Wisconsin</a></span><br />Herd du Wisconsin<br /><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=BC_Ma%C5%BEeikiai&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"BC Ma\u017eeikiai (page inexistante)\">BC Ma\u017eeikiai</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BC_Ma%C5%BEeikiai\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:BC Ma\u017eeikiai\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;BC Ma\u017eeikiai&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a><br /><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=KK_Podgorica&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"KK Podgorica (page inexistante)\">KK Podgorica</a>&#160;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KK_Podgorica\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:KK Podgorica\"><span class=\"indicateur-langue\" title=\"Article en anglais&#160;: \u00ab&#160;KK Podgorica&#160;\u00bb\">(en)</span></a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/PAOK_Salonique_(basket-ball)\" title=\"PAOK Salonique (basket-ball)\">PAOK Salonique</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Aris_Salonique_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Aris Salonique (basket-ball)\">\u00c1ris Salonique</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Bucks_de_Milwaukee\" title=\"Bucks de Milwaukee\">Bucks de Milwaukee</a><br /><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> Herd du Wisconsin</td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>0,0<br />12,4<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,8<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,6<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,7<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>8,6<br />10,5<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>1,2<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>0,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Emeka Adetokunbo</b>, dit <b>Al\u00e9xandros \u00ab&#160;Al\u00e9xis&#160;\u00bb Antetoko\u00fanmpo</b> (en <a href=\"/wiki/Grec_moderne\" title=\"Grec moderne\">grec moderne</a>&#160;: <span class=\"lang-el\" lang=\"el\">\u0391\u03bb\u03ad\u03be\u03b1\u03bd\u03b4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c2 \u00ab\u0391\u03bb\u03ad\u03be\u03b7\u03c2\u00bb \u0391\u03bd\u03c4\u03b5\u03c4\u03bf\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd\u03bd\u03bc\u03c0\u03bf</span>) ou plus fr\u00e9quemment <b>\u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo</b> (<span class=\"lang-el\" lang=\"el\">\u0386\u03bb\u03b5\u03be \u0391\u03bd\u03c4\u03b5\u03c4\u03bf\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd\u03bd\u03bc\u03c0\u03bf</span>), n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2001-08-26\" data-sort-value=\"2001-08-26\">26 ao\u00fbt 2001</time>, est un joueur de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> professionnel <a href=\"/wiki/Nigeria\" title=\"Nigeria\">nig\u00e9riano</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/Gr%C3%A8ce\" title=\"Gr\u00e8ce\">grec</a>. \n</p><p>Il est le plus jeune fr\u00e8re de la fratrie Antetoko\u00fanmpo, dont les fr\u00e8res <a href=\"/wiki/Gi%C3%A1nnis_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" title=\"Gi\u00e1nnis Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">Gi\u00e1nnis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Than%C3%A1sis_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" title=\"Than\u00e1sis Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">Than\u00e1sis</a> et <a href=\"/wiki/K%C3%B3stas_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" title=\"K\u00f3stas Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">K\u00f3stas</a> jouent au basket-ball et ont \u00e9volu\u00e9 au sein de la <a href=\"/wiki/National_Basketball_Association\" title=\"National Basketball Association\">National Basketball Association</a> (NBA).\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Jeunesse\">Jeunesse</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Jeunesse\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Jeunesse\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>\u00c1lex est n\u00e9 \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Sep%C3%B3lia\" title=\"Sep\u00f3lia\">Sep\u00f3lia</a>, un quartier d'<a href=\"/wiki/Ath%C3%A8nes\" title=\"Ath\u00e8nes\">Ath\u00e8nes</a>, en <a href=\"/wiki/Gr%C3%A8ce\" title=\"Gr\u00e8ce\">Gr\u00e8ce</a>. Ses parents avaient immigr\u00e9 du <a href=\"/wiki/Nigeria\" title=\"Nigeria\">Nigeria</a> et avaient du mal \u00e0 joindre les deux bouts. Il commence \u00e0 jouer au basket-ball \u00e0 l'\u00e2ge de neuf ans et grandit en jouant avec et en regardant ses fr\u00e8res a\u00een\u00e9s<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-fader&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-fader-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. En sixi\u00e8me, \u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo d\u00e9m\u00e9nage avec sa famille \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Milwaukee\" title=\"Milwaukee\">Milwaukee</a>, o\u00f9 <a href=\"/wiki/Gi%C3%A1nnis_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" title=\"Gi\u00e1nnis Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">Gi\u00e1nnis</a> joue sa premi\u00e8re saison pour les <a href=\"/wiki/Bucks_de_Milwaukee\" title=\"Bucks de Milwaukee\">Bucks de Milwaukee</a>. Il fr\u00e9quente l'\u00e9cole St. Monica \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Whitefish_Bay\" title=\"Whitefish Bay\">Whitefish Bay</a>, dans le <a href=\"/wiki/Wisconsin\" title=\"Wisconsin\">Wisconsin</a> et ne parle pas l'anglais au d\u00e9part<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-hogg&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-hogg-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Antetoko\u00fanmpo joue au basket-ball pour le lyc\u00e9e Dominican de Whitefish Bay pendant quatre ans. Comme \u00e9tudiant de premi\u00e8re ann\u00e9e, il inscrit en moyenne 2,9 points par match et grandit d'environ 12,7 cm pour atteindre 2,03 m, au moment pendant sa deuxi\u00e8me ann\u00e9e<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-hogg&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-hogg-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. \u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo inscrit en moyenne 20 points et prend 7 rebonds par match en troisi\u00e8me ann\u00e9e.\n</p><p>Il re\u00e7oit des offres de bourses d'\u00e9tudes de <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Demons_de_DePaul\" title=\"Blue Demons de DePaul\">DePaul</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bobcats_de_l%27Ohio\" title=\"Bobcats de l&#39;Ohio\">Ohio</a> et Green Bay<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-05-09\" data-sort-value=\"2020-05-09\">9 mai 2020</time>, \u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo annonce qu'il allait jouer en Europe apr\u00e8s avoir obtenu son dipl\u00f4me d'\u00e9tudes secondaires, plut\u00f4t que de jouer au niveau <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball_universitaire_aux_%C3%89tats-Unis\" title=\"Basket-ball universitaire aux \u00c9tats-Unis\">universitaire</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Carri\u00e8re_professionnelle\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re_professionnelle\"></span>Carri\u00e8re professionnelle</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re professionnelle\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-22\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-22\">22 juin 2020</time>, Antetoko\u00fanmpo signe un contrat de trois ans avec l'<a href=\"/wiki/CB_Murcie\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CB Murcie\">UCAM Murcie</a>, club de <a href=\"/wiki/Championnat_d%27Espagne_de_basket-ball\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Championnat d&#39;Espagne de basket-ball\">Liga ACB</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-murcia&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-murcia-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Il joue son premier match en Espagne avec l'\u00e9quipe B de l'UCAM qui \u00e9volue en liga EBA (Liga Espa\u00f1ola de Baloncesto Aficionado, la quatri\u00e8me division espagnole) en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-10\" data-sort-value=\"2020-10\">octobre 2020</time> et marque 28 points (\u00e0 6 sur 9 \u00e0 trois points)<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>\u00c1lex Antetoko\u00fanmpo n'est pas choisi lors de la <a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2021_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2021 de la NBA\">draft 2021 de la NBA</a> et rejoint les <a href=\"/wiki/Raptors_905\" title=\"Raptors 905\">Raptors 905</a>, l'\u00e9quipe de <a href=\"/wiki/NBA_Gatorade_League\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NBA Gatorade League\">G-league</a> affili\u00e9e aux <a href=\"/wiki/Raptors_de_Toronto\" title=\"Raptors de Toronto\">Raptors de Toronto</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-10\" data-sort-value=\"2025-10\">octobre 2025</time>, \u00c1lex rejoint les <a href=\"/wiki/Bucks_de_Milwaukee\" title=\"Bucks de Milwaukee\">Bucks de Milwaukee</a> (avec un <a href=\"/wiki/Two-way_contract\" title=\"Two-way contract\">two-way contract</a>) o\u00f9 jouent ses fr\u00e8res Gi\u00e1nnis et Than\u00e1sis. C'est la premi\u00e8re fois dans l'histoire de la NBA que trois fr\u00e8res jouent dans la m\u00eame \u00e9quipe<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vie_priv\u00e9e\"><span id=\"Vie_priv.C3.A9e\"></span>Vie priv\u00e9e</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Vie priv\u00e9e\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Vie priv\u00e9e\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>\u00c1lex est le fils de parents nig\u00e9rians, Veronica et Charles Adetokunbo. Son fr\u00e8re <a href=\"/wiki/K%C3%B3stas_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo\" title=\"K\u00f3stas Antetoko\u00fanmpo\">K\u00f3stas</a> re\u00e7oit officiellement la citoyennet\u00e9 grecque en 2016<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. En outre, il poss\u00e8de un passeport nig\u00e9rian, qui lui a \u00e9t\u00e9 accord\u00e9 en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2013-06\" data-sort-value=\"2013-06\">juin 2013</time>, afin d'obtenir un visa et d'\u00eatre autoris\u00e9 \u00e0 entrer l\u00e9galement aux \u00c9tats-Unis<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Le p\u00e8re d'\u00c1lex et son fr\u00e8re a\u00een\u00e9, Francis, ont jou\u00e9 au <a href=\"/wiki/Football\" title=\"Football\">football</a> au <a href=\"/wiki/Nigeria\" title=\"Nigeria\">Nigeria</a>. Sa m\u00e8re est une <a href=\"/wiki/Saut_en_hauteur\" title=\"Saut en hauteur\">sauteuse en hauteur</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-npr&#95;10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-npr-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-09\" data-sort-value=\"2021-09\">septembre 2021</time>, \u00c1lex et sa m\u00e8re Veronica obtiennent la nationalit\u00e9 grecque<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span id=\"R.C3.A9f.C3.A9rences\"></span>R\u00e9f\u00e9rences</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%81lex_Antetoko%C3%BAnmpo&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : R\u00e9f\u00e9rences\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"references-small decimal\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-fader-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-fader_1-0\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Fader2019\">Fader, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bleacherreport.com/articles/2845193-the-rise-of-the-next-antetokounmpo\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">The Rise of the Next Antetokounmpo</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <a href=\"/wiki/Bleacher_Report\" title=\"Bleacher Report\">Bleacher Report</a>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-07-18\" data-sort-value=\"2019-07-18\">18 juillet 2019</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-23\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-23\">23 juin 2020</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-hogg-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink noprint\">\u2191 <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-hogg_2-0\">a</a> et <a href=\"#cite_ref-hogg_2-1\">b</a></sup> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Hogg2018\">Hogg, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/sports/high-schools/2018/12/26/alex-antetokounmpo-younger-brother-giannis-makes-name-himself/2366906002/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">With help from his brother, Alex Antetokounmpo is taking on a 'killer' mentality and making a name for himself</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <span class=\"italique\"><a href=\"/wiki/Milwaukee_Journal_Sentinel\" title=\"Milwaukee Journal Sentinel\">Milwaukee Journal Sentinel</a></span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2018-12-26\" data-sort-value=\"2018-12-26\">26 d\u00e9cembre 2018</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-22\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-22\">22 juin 2020</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/29157514/giannis-antetokounmpo-brother-alex-skip-college-play-europe\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Giannis' youngest brother, Alex, to play in Europe</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">ESPN.com</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-05-10\" data-sort-value=\"2020-05-10\">10 mai 2020</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-25\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-25\">25 juin 2020</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-murcia-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-murcia_4-0\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : espagnol\">(es)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ucamdeportes.com/ucamcb/noticias/el-ucam-murcia-ficha-alex-antetokounmpo\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"es\">El UCAM Murcia ficha a Alex Antetokounmpo</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, UCAM Murcia CB, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-22\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-22\">22 juin 2020</time> <small style=\"line-height:1em;\">(consult\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-06-22\" data-sort-value=\"2020-06-22\">22 juin 2020</time>)</small></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Rutard2020\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Sacha&#95;Rutard2020\">Sacha Rutard, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.basketeurope.com/livenews-fr/520883/espagne-28-points-pour-alex-antetokounmpo-pour-son-premier-match-en-eba/\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">Espagne: 28 points pour Alex Antetokounmpo pour son premier match en EBA</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, Basket Europe, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2020-10-20\" data-sort-value=\"2020-10-20\">20 octobre 2020</time></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Irving2021\"><span class=\"ouvrage\" id=\"Kyle&#95;Irving2021\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> Kyle Irving, \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sportingnews.com/ca/nba/news/toronto-raptors-waive-alex-antetokounmpo-josh-hall-raptors-905/1pdn8r3m3oyn11oaf7ygmfeoe0\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Toronto Raptors waive Alex Antetokounmpo and Josh Hall, both to join Raptors 905</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, sur <span class=\"italique\">Sporting News</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-10-15\" data-sort-value=\"2021-10-15\">15 octobre 2021</time></span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><abbr class=\"abbr indicateur-langue\" title=\"Langue : anglais\">(en)</abbr> \u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.reuters.com/sports/report-bucks-signing-third-antetokounmpo-brother-alex--flm-2025-10-13\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\" lang=\"en\">Bucks signing third Antetokounmpo brother, Alex</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb, <a href=\"/wiki/Reuters\" title=\"Reuters\">Reuters</a>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2025-10-13\" data-sort-value=\"2025-10-13\">13 octobre 2025</time></span>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.matrix24.gr/2016/01/vgazi-elliniko-diavatirio-o-kostas-antetokounmpo/\">matrix24.gr \u0392\u03b3\u03ac\u03b6\u03b5\u03b9 \u03b5\u03bb\u03bb\u03b7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03b2\u03b1\u03c4\u03ae\u03c1\u03b9\u03bf \u03bf \u039a\u03ce\u03c3\u03c4\u03b1\u03c2 \u0391\u03bd\u03c4\u03b5\u03c4\u03bf\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd\u03bd\u03bc\u03c0\u03bf</a> </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gazzetta.gr/basketball/article/916698/i-halasmeni-kafetiera\">gazzetta.gr \u0397 \u03c7\u03b1\u03bb\u03b1\u03c3\u03bc\u03ad\u03bd\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03c6\u03b5\u03c4\u03b9\u03ad\u03c1\u03b1</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-npr-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-npr_10-0\">\u2191</a> </span><span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"ouvrage\"><span class=\"noarchive\">\u00ab&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.npr.org/2013/09/26/226268651/nbas-g-bo-wants-to-bring-hope-to-greece-and-to-milwaukee\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">NBA Rookie Wants To Bring Hope To Greece, And To Milwaukee</cite></a>&#160;\u00bb <small class=\"plainlinks cachelinks\">&#91;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160423082144/http://www.npr.org/2013/09/26/226268651/nbas-g-bo-wants-to-bring-hope-to-greece-and-to-milwaukee\">archive du <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2016-04-23\" data-sort-value=\"2016-04-23\">23 avril 2016</time></a>&#93;</small></span>, <span class=\"italique\">NPR.com</span>, <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2013-09-26\" data-sort-value=\"2013-09-26\">26 septembre